# Direct production runtime dependencies for the supported Dashboard + FastAPI
# service path.  Resolve these only with factory-runtime.constraints.txt.
#
# This file intentionally excludes legacy Flask/collector code, development
# tools and the non-operational legacy PySpin SDK.  See README.ko.md.
-c factory-runtime.constraints.txt
fastapi
uvicorn[standard]
SQLAlchemy
PyMySQL
python-dotenv
requests
numpy
Pillow
opencv-python
